Green Plant Maintenance is a convenient way to record the daily growth status of your own green plants. Looking at the green plants every day and taking care of them is also a relaxing way of life; Cultivate your own green plants, record their growth status, and alleviate life stress.

Green Plant Maintenance: Add plants to my garden, take photos of them, record their growth process, generate a garden photo, and the system can automatically create a plant maintenance record file.

Main functions：
-Add your Green Plant;
-Record changes to your Green Plant profile;
-Record the name of the Green Plant;
-Record the start time of the Green Plant;
-Record the maintenance notes of Green Plant;
-Record photos of Green Plant;

Green Plant Maintenance is an application that helps you keep track of flower maintenance records.
